<title>FRANCE: Pathe reports 132 mln Ffr H1 net profit.</title>
<headline>Pathe reports 132 mln Ffr H1 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half of 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net						132  vs		40</p>
<p>Net before tax, interest,</p>
<p>    depreciation and amortization	    325  vs	     128</p>
<p>    Turnover					 898  vs	     298</p>
<p>NOTE - Pathe was formed in June from the split of Chargeurs SA into two quoted companies, with Pathe taking the media interests of Chargeurs SA diversified conglomerate and the rest being taken over by the other newly quoted firm, Chargeurs International. 1995 comparatives are pro-forma.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
